{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4afc53ca0624334c","name":"Blaster Recharge Interface","source":{"id":"source:reference-4afc53ca0624334c","title":"Blaster Recharge Interface","revision":16270,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:35Z","sha256":"aa713207c67a2eb2f4eb8b206cbd964164b4be175b2f6233f62a691f50c95903","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16270","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Blaster%20Recharge%20Interface&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4afc53ca0624334c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 300\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This handy accessory enables a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to recharge a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," for its master. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can plug in and transfer energy to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},". Recharging a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," depletes energy from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". For each recharge, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," loses ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to one of the blaster's damage-dice type. Thus, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," recharging a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:7fb29dca115dd7cd"}," (3d8) takes 8 points of damage (since the die type is d8).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
